    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DIANA: Excuse me? I have a question.\nDIANA: Hey... Hello... Miss?\nDIANA: Excuse me.\nDIANA: Katie! Hi. Interesting reading material there, huh. How are you doing today, good?",
      "BONNIE: Uh... hi. Was there another lady in here, taller than me, probably talking a lot?\nKATIE: Jesus Christ!\nDIANA: Do. Better.\nBONNIE: Thanks so much.",
      "BONNIE: So that went well.\nDIANA: It's like the entire world is asleep! And even when they're awake, they're barely there. Laziness is contagious, Bonnie, and we're supposed …\nBONNIE: Is this about sixty?\nDIANA: What? No. And by the way, for tomorrow, I don't want anything. No cake. Not even, like, a small grocery store cake--",
      "DIANA: Maybe you missed your calling, Mom.\nLUCY: I know. About the magnet.\nDIANA: No idea what you're talking about.\nLUCY: That's why you give me the ball with the yellow stripe. So I win every time!",
      "LUCY: Diana? Come here.\nLUCY: Was I the worst mother in the world?\nDIANA: Are you kidding? You were the best.\nDIANA: Okay, Mom? We'll let you rest."
    ]
  },
